<title>HONG KONG: BZW Asia names Davis as regional chief executive.</title>
<headline>BZW Asia names Davis as regional chief executive.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>BZW Asia Ltd said on Wednesday it had appointed Roger Davis as chief executive for Asia.</p>
<p>Davis will join in February from Jardine Fleming in India, the brokerage said in a press release.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6352</p>
</text>
